{"reviewId": "255567194_85abFT1Ya", "review": {"abstract": "我们现在谈论城市化，实际上与我们未来的产业选择有极大的关联性。因为我们把城市化作为本次经济起飞的原动力，所以，未来产业多样化过程中的主导产业将会沿着城市化的线索展开，对这一点，国际经验早有证明", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "说白了我们还是在走西方的老路 而西方现在已经结束城镇化 向人工智能时代迈进 我们需要在进行城镇化的同时 抓紧开展人工智能领域的研究 否则就会出现“一步赶不上步步赶不上”的窘境...", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "7701-7797", "createTime": 1764907617, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "255567194_85abFT1Ya", "userVid": 255567194, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 255567194, "name": "咖啡豆", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0021-86nrSu9ZFS5TbWIKQUwhFf7/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "读万卷书，行万里路，然后成为更好的自己！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-10", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作爱好者", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "我的理解是这样的，因为2005年全球步入衰退，不可能有新技术出来重启新的周期。但现在有可能是新周期的起点，有可能有新技术的出现，如果哪个国家能够在这个新技术上走在前面，那么就可能成为全球经济发展引领者了", "reviewId": "255567194_85abFT1Ya", "commentId": "255567194_85abFT1Ya_c426066534_88wIbXl8D", "userVid": 426066534, "createTime": 1776751856, "likesCount": 1, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBla